    "body": "Fixes #42239.\n\n## Problem\n\n`vim._with({ buf = 0, win = 0 }, ...)` hits an assertion in `ctx_switch()`, which accepts only one of `buf` and `win`.\n\n## Solution\n\nIgnore `buf` when `win` is given, since the window implies its buffer. Adds a functional test in `with_spec.lua`, which fails before the change and passes after.\n",
